{"id":"vod_sn_35736","vodId":"35736","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"风人物语","name_cn":"风人物语","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/7c285f53b721eae00eb5211d3563c858.jpg"},"summary":"高中女生奈绪（名冢佳织 配音）隶属摄影部，她喜欢捕捉云和风。一天，她在学校天台拍照时，看见一只飞天猫，随即天空居然下起了“猫雨”，震惊之余她不慎失足坠楼。出乎意料的是，从高空中摔下的她竟毫发无损。原来是拥有操纵风的能力的风使——大气老师救了她，而那只猫之所以会飞也是因为它懂得操纵风。得知大气老师回乡参加祭典后，奈绪和好朋友美纪（花村怜美 配音）以及同班男生阿润（入野自由 配音）一起来到风使之乡找他，向他学习风的知识，老师却一口回绝。目睹了震撼人心的风之祭典后，奈绪似乎更加了解风……　　本动画围绕着奈绪的日常展开，她的高中生活也许平平凡凡，然而故事里有风。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:37:14","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/azXtDgREpE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/dWt1SX4aux1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/mJZWhREnEA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/vF13J3ysW71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/JRrCHezLnj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/U7k3zp8quQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/DzcBkvdXsH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/f42p0EHxEA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ASbJEgvtkf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/tPJ98NxhAi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/T4nQKadStD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/0kWirGX02q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/yJH9fvqqKM1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:31.535Z"}